"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 都市内の巡察
#. de: Patrouille des Stadtgebiets
#. fr: Patrouille urbaine
#. column 9: Patrol city streets and maintain peace in <switch $n1><case>Limsa Lominsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch>.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:1:0:8"
msgid "City Patrol"
msgstr "Городской патруль"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>リムサ・ロミンサ<case>グリダニア<case>ウルダハ</switch>都市内の定期巡回を命じる。指定された巡回地点を巡り、都市内の安全を確保されたし。
#. de: Mehrere Bewohner <switch $n1><case>Limsa Lominsas<case>Gridanias<case>Ul'dahs</switch> haben verdächtig aussehende Landstreicher gesichtet. Der Befehl lautet: Das Stadtgebiet patrouillieren und für Sicherheit sorgen!
#. fr: Simple patrouille à l'intérieur <switch $n1><case>de Limsa Lominsa<case>de Gridania<case>d'Ul'dah</switch> pour assurer la sécurité des citoyens.
#. column 8: City Patrol
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Limsa Lominsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:1:0:9"
msgid "Patrol city streets and maintain peace in <switch $n1><case>Limsa Lominsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch>."
msgstr "Патрулируйте улицы <switch $n1><case>Лимсы Ломинсы<case>Гридании<case>Ульды</switch> и поддерживайте порядок."

#. ja: 近隣拠点への伝令
#. de: Lieferung an einen Außenposten
#. fr: Liaison vers poste avancé
#. column 9: Deliver written orders to unit stationed <switch $n1><case>at the De Nevelle Checkpoint<case>at the Bannock<case>at Sagolii Gate</switch>.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:2:0:8"
msgid "Military Courier"
msgstr "Военный курьер"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>デネベール関門<case>バノック練兵所<case>サゴリー関所</switch>への伝令を命じる。軍関係の書類を該当施設に駐屯する部隊へと届けるべし。
#. de: Das Personal <switch $n1><case>am De Nevelle-Grenzposten<case>am Stubben<case>am Sagolii-Grenzposten</switch> wartet auf neue Marschbefehle. Der Befehl lautet: Die Dokumente sicher ans Ziel bringen!
#. fr: Ordre de transmettre un message important aux hommes <switch $n1><case>du poste de Nevelle<case>du Bannock<case>de la porte de Sagolii</switch>.
#. column 8: Military Courier
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>at the De Nevelle Checkpoint<case>at the Bannock<case>at Sagolii Gate</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:2:0:9"
msgid "Deliver written orders to unit stationed <switch $n1><case>at the De Nevelle Checkpoint<case>at the Bannock<case>at Sagolii Gate</switch>."
msgstr "Доставьте письменный приказ подразделению, находящемуся <switch $n1><case>на заставе Де Невель<case>в Банноке<case>у ворот Саголии</switch>."

#. ja: 都市周辺の街道巡回
#. de: Sicherung der Verkehrswege
#. fr: Patrouille périphérique
#. column 9: Patrol <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> and eliminate potential threats to travelers.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:3:0:8"
msgid "Outskirts Patrol"
msgstr "Патруль на окраинах"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>中央ラノシア<case>黒衣森：中央森林<case>中央ザナラーン</switch>の主要街道の巡回を命じる。都市民や旅人、隊商たちの安全を脅かす魔物は、発見次第、排除すべし。
#. de: Gefährliche Kreaturen attackieren Reisende und Händler <switch $n1><case>im zentralen La Noscea<case>im Tiefen Wald<case>im zentralen Thanalan</switch>. Der Befehl lautet: Die wichtigsten Verkehrswege sichern!
#. fr: Ordre de patrouiller sur les routes <switch $n1><case>de la Noscea centrale<case>de la Forêt centrale<case>du Thanalan central</switch> et d'éliminer les créatures pouvant attaquer les voyageurs et marchands.
#. column 8: Outskirts Patrol
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:3:0:9"
msgid "Patrol <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> and eliminate potential threats to travelers."
msgstr "Патрулируйте <switch $n1><case>Среднюю Ла-Носкею<case>Центральный лес<case>Центральный Таналан</switch> и устраняйте угрозы для путников."

#. ja: 蛮族部隊の偵察
#. de: Auskundschaften des Wilden Stammes
#. fr: Repérage de positions hommes-bêtes
#. column 9: <switch $n1><case>Group of kobold pickmen spotted in lower La Noscea<case>Ixal raiding party spotted in the South Shroud<case>Amalj'aa war party spotted in central Thanalan</switch>. Confirm presence of beastmen, and report current location. DO NOT ENGAGE.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:4:0:8"
msgid "Beastmen Recon"
msgstr "Разведка зверолюдов"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>低地ラノシアにてコボルド族<case>南部森林にてイクサル族<case>中央ザナラーンにてアマルジャ族</switch>を目撃したとの情報が寄せられた。ただちに現場に急行し、敵軍の動向を偵察し報告せよ。
#. de: Augenzeugen melden eine Anrottung von <switch $n1><case>Kobolden<case>Ixal<case>Amalj'aa</switch> <switch $n1><case>im unteren La Noscea<case>im Südwald<case>im zentralen Thanalan</switch>. Der Befehl lautet: Die Ansammlung finden und die feindlichen Aktivitäten beobachten!
#. fr: Des <switch $n1><case>Kobolds<case>Ixali<case>Amalj'aa</switch> auraient été aperçus <switch $n1><case>dans la Basse-Noscea<case>dans la Forêt du sud<case>dans le Thanalan central</switch>. Ordre d'aller sur place et d'observer les mouvements de l'ennemi.
#. column 8: Beastmen Recon
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Group of kobold pickmen spotted in lower La Noscea<case>Ixal raiding party spotted in the South Shroud<case>Amalj'aa war party spotted in cent… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:4:0:9"
msgid "<switch $n1><case>Group of kobold pickmen spotted in lower La Noscea<case>Ixal raiding party spotted in the South Shroud<case>Amalj'aa war party spotted in central Thanalan</switch>. Confirm presence of beastmen, and report current location. DO NOT ENGAGE."
msgstr "<switch $n1><case>В Нижней Ла-Носкее замечена группа кобольдов-добытчиков<case>В Южном лесу замечен отряд иксалов<case>В Центральном Таналане замечен отряд амалджаа</switch>. Установите, где находятся зверолюди, и доложите об их местоположении. В бой не вступать!"

#. ja: 補給部隊の護衛
#. de: Geleit eines Versorgungszugs
#. fr: Escorte d'une unité de ravitaillement
#. column 9: Escort supply wagon to <switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Amarissaix's Spire<case>Camp Drybone</switch>. Remain alert for possible threats, and ensure supplies arrive undamaged.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:5:0:8"
msgid "Supply Wagon Escort"
msgstr "Сопровождение обоза"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>キャンプ・スカルバレー<case>アマリセ監視哨<case>キャンプ・ドライボーン</switch>に向かう補給部隊の護衛を命じる。いかなる時も警戒を怠らず、補給部隊の安全を確保せよ。
#. de: Ein Feuer hat die Vorräte der Einheit <switch $n1><case>in Camp Schädeltal<case>an Amarissaixes Wachturm<case>in Camp Knochenbleich</switch> zerstört. Der Befehl lautet: Den Versorgungszug begleiten und beschützen!
#. fr: Ordre d'escorter une unité de ra<shy>vi<shy>tail<shy>le<shy>ment jusqu'<switch $n1><case>au camp de la vallée du Crâne<case>à la tour d'Amarissaix<case>au camp des Os desséchés</switch> et d'en assurer la sécurité à tout prix.
#. column 8: Supply Wagon Escort
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Amarissaix's Spire<case>Camp Drybone</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:5:0:9"
msgid "Escort supply wagon to <switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Amarissaix's Spire<case>Camp Drybone</switch>. Remain alert for possible threats, and ensure supplies arrive undamaged."
msgstr "Сопроводите обоз с припасами до <switch $n1><case>лагеря «Долина Черепов»<case>заставы Амариссе<case>лагеря «Сухие кости»</switch>. Будьте начеку и проследите, чтобы припасы добрались целыми."

#. ja: 害獣の駆除
#. de: Schutz von Siedlern
#. fr: Extermination de créatures gênantes
#. column 9: Residents of <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> request military support. Deploy to area, and cull <switch $n1><case>goobbue<case>treant<case>giant tortoise</switch> population.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:6:0:8"
msgid "Pest Eradication"
msgstr "Истребление вредителей"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>中央ラノシア<case>黒衣森：中央森林<case>中央ザナラーン</switch>の住人から、<switch $n1><case>グゥーブー<case>トレント<case>ジャイアントトータス</switch>の駆除要請が届いた。ただちに現場に赴き、これ以上の害獣被害を食い止めよ。
#. de: Siedler <switch $n1><case>im zentralen La Noscea<case>im Tiefen Wald<case>im zentralen Thanalan</switch> werden von ungewöhnlich aggressiven <switch $n1><case>Goobbue<case>Baumschraten<case>Riesenschildkröten</switch> heimgesucht. Der Befehl lautet: Die Bedrohung für die Siedler beseitigen!
#. fr: Des habitants <switch $n1><case>de la Noscea centrale<case>de la Forêt centrale<case>du Thanalan central</switch> ont réclamé l'extermination de <switch $n1><case>goobbues<case>tréants<case>tortues géantes</switch> qui gênent leurs activités.
#. column 8: Pest Eradication
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>goobbue<case>treant<case>giant tortoise</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:6:0:9"
msgid "Residents of <switch $n1><case>middle La Noscea<case>the Central Shroud<case>central Thanalan</switch> request military support. Deploy to area, and cull <switch $n1><case>goobbue<case>treant<case>giant tortoise</switch> population."
msgstr "Жители <switch $n1><case>Средней Ла-Носкеи<case>Центрального леса<case>Центрального Таналана</switch> просят военной помощи. Отправляйтесь туда и сократите численность <switch $n1><case>губбу<case>энт<case>гигантских черепах</switch>."

#. ja: 重要任務：低級妖異の排除
#. de: ★ Beseitigung eines Nichtsgesandten
#. fr: Élimination d'être du néant (important)
#. column 9: Cabal of minor voidsent spotted in vicinity of <switch $n1><case>Woad Whisper Canyon<case>Spirithold<case>Nophica's Wells</switch>. Deploy to area and execute thorough “sweep and eliminate.”
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:7:0:8"
msgid "Flagged Mission: Voidsent Elimination"
msgstr "Особое задание: уничтожение безднорожденных"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>ささやきの谷<case>ウォーレン牢獄<case>ノフィカの井戸</switch>にて、低級妖異と思しき影が目撃された。このまま捨て置けば、いずれ現地住民に被害が出かねない。ただちに現場に急行し、確実にすべての妖異を撃滅せよ。
#. de: Wildkraut-Sammler haben <switch $n1><case>in der Flüsterklamm<case>am Geisterkerker<case>bei Nophicas Brunnen</switch> einen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten niederen Ranges gesichtet. Der Befehl lautet: Den Dämonen beseitigen und nach weiteren Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten Ausschau halten!
#. fr: Un démon mineur a été aperçu près <switch $n1><case>du canyon des Chuchotements<case>de la Prison des esprits<case>des sources de Nophica</switch>. Ordre de l'éliminer avant qu'il n'occasionne des pertes civiles.
#. column 8: Flagged Mission: Voidsent Elimination
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Woad Whisper Canyon<case>Spirithold<case>Nophica's Wells</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:7:0:9"
msgid "Cabal of minor voidsent spotted in vicinity of <switch $n1><case>Woad Whisper Canyon<case>Spirithold<case>Nophica's Wells</switch>. Deploy to area and execute thorough “sweep and eliminate.”"
msgstr "В окрестностях <switch $n1><case>Каньона Шёпота<case>Пристанища духов<case>Колодцев Нофики</switch> замечены группы низших исчадий. Отправляйтесь туда и тщательно прочешите местность, уничтожив всех до единого."

#. ja: 前線部隊の支援
#. de: Unterstützung eines Grenzpostens
#. fr: Soutien aux unités avancées
#. column 9: <switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Eugenia's Spire<case>Little Ala Mhigo</switch> garrison requests reinforcements. Deploy to area and repel <switch $n1><case>kobold<case>Ixali<case>Amalj'aa</switch> assault.
#, aeria-term-model-exception: Frontline e6dd84541bfd
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:8:0:8"
msgid "Frontline Support"
msgstr "Поддержка передового отряда"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>キャンプ・スカルバレー<case>ユージニア監視哨<case>リトルアラミゴ</switch>の駐留部隊より、支援要請が入った。<switch $n1><case>コボルド族<case>イクサル族<case>アマルジャ族</switch>の迎撃に向かう当地の部隊を支援せよ。
#. de: Die <switch $n1><case>in Camp Schädeltal<case>an Eugenias Wachturm<case>in Klein-Ala Mhigo</switch> stationierten Truppen leiden unter heftigen Angriffen der <switch $n1><case>Kobolde<case>Ixal<case>Amalj'aa</switch> und haben ein dringendes Hilfsgesuch geschickt. Der Befehl lautet: Die Truppen im Kampf gegen den Wilden Stamm unterstützen!
#. fr: L'unité en poste <switch $n1><case>au camp de la vallée du Crâne<case>à la tour d'Eugenia<case>à Petite Ala Mhigo</switch> a demandé du soutien pour faire face à un assaut des <switch $n1><case>Kobolds<case>Ixali<case>Amalj'aa</switch>.
#. column 8: Frontline Support
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Eugenia's Spire<case>Little Ala Mhigo</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>kobold<case>Ixali<case>Amalj'aa</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:8:0:9"
msgid "<switch $n1><case>Camp Skull Valley<case>Eugenia's Spire<case>Little Ala Mhigo</switch> garrison requests reinforcements. Deploy to area and repel <switch $n1><case>kobold<case>Ixali<case>Amalj'aa</switch> assault."
msgstr "Гарнизон <switch $n1><case>лагеря «Долина Черепов»<case>заставы Евгении<case>Малого Ала-Миго</switch> просит подкрепления. Выдвигайтесь на место и отбейте нападение <switch $n1><case>кобольдов<case>иксалов<case>амалджаа</switch>."

#. ja: 同盟軍将校の護衛
#. de: Geleit einer Befehlshaberin
#. fr: Escorte d'officier de l'Alliance
#. column 9: High-ranking <switch $n1><case>serpent<case>flame<case>storm</switch> officer to visit city to plan Alliance strategies. Meet said officer at airship landing, and serve as personal guard for visit duration.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:9:0:8"
msgid "Officer Escort"
msgstr "Сопровождение офицера"

#. ja: 重要な会合のため、<switch $n1><case>双蛇党<case>不滅隊<case>黒渦団</switch>の将校が我が都市に来訪することになった。ランディングにて出迎え、滞在期間中の案内と護衛に万全を尽くせ。
#. de: Eine hochrangige Befehlshaberin <switch $n1><case>der Bruderschaft<case>der Legion<case>des Mahlstroms</switch> kommt für eine wichtige Lagebesprechung nach <switch $n1><case>Limsa Lominsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch>. Der Befehl lautet: Den Luftschiff-Landeplatz sichern und der Besucherin Geleit geben!
#. fr: Ordre d'assurer la sécurité d'un officier <switch $n1><case>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères<case>des Immortels<case>du Maelstrom</switch> qui doit venir dans notre cité pour une importante réunion d'état-major de l'Alliance éorzéenne.
#. column 8: Officer Escort
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>serpent<case>flame<case>storm</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:9:0:9"
msgid "High-ranking <switch $n1><case>serpent<case>flame<case>storm</switch> officer to visit city to plan Alliance strategies. Meet said officer at airship landing, and serve as personal guard for visit duration."
msgstr "Высокопоставленный офицер <switch $n1><case>Двух Змей<case>Бессмертного Пламени<case>Водоворота</switch> прибудет в город для обсуждения стратегии Альянса. Встретьте его у посадочной площадки дирижаблей и охраняйте до конца визита."

#. ja: 郊外の街道巡回
#. de: Sicherung der Handelsstraßen
#. fr: Patrouille des routes éloignées
#. column 9: Patrol <switch $n1><case>eastern La Noscea<case>the South Shroud<case>southern Thanalan</switch> and ensure major trade routes are secure.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:10:0:8"
msgid "Border Patrol"
msgstr "Патруль на границе"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>東ラノシア<case>黒衣森：南部森林<case>南ザナラーン</switch>の主要街道の巡回を命じる。物資輸送の要となる街道の治安を守るべく、目を光らせよ。
#. de: Wegelagerer bedrohen die Sicherheit der Handelsrouten <switch $n1><case>im östlichen La Noscea<case>im Südwald<case>im südlichen Thanalan</switch>. Der Befehl lautet: Die wichtigsten Handelsstraßen sichern und die fahrenden Kaufleute beschützen!
#. fr: Ordre de patrouiller sur les routes <switch $n1><case>de la Noscea orientale<case>de la Forêt du sud<case>du Thanalan méridional</switch> afin d'assurer les principaux axes de circulation et de commerce.
#. column 8: Border Patrol
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>eastern La Noscea<case>the South Shroud<case>southern Thanalan</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:10:0:9"
msgid "Patrol <switch $n1><case>eastern La Noscea<case>the South Shroud<case>southern Thanalan</switch> and ensure major trade routes are secure."
msgstr "Патрулируйте <switch $n1><case>Восточную Ла-Носкею<case>Южный лес<case>Южный Таналан</switch> и обеспечьте безопасность главных торговых путей."

#. ja: 蛮族拠点の威力偵察
#. de: Störaktion in einem feindlichen Lager
#. fr: Espionnage de base homme-bête
#. column 9: Reconnoiter the <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch> and assess enemy forces. Avoid engagements when possible, but mission completion takes priority.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:11:0:8"
msgid "Stronghold Recon"
msgstr "Разведка в крепости"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>コボルド軍試掘地<case>イクサル軍伐採所<case>アマルジャ軍陣屋</switch>への威力偵察を命じる。敵性蛮族の迎撃が予想されるが、これを排除しつつ情報を持ち帰れ。
#. de: <switch $n1><case>Das Flotten<shy>kommando fürchtet<case>Die Priester im Abaton fürchten<case>Die Stabsoffiziere in der Ewigen Halle fürchten</switch> einen bevorstehenden Angriff <switch $n1><case>der Kobolde<case>der Ixal<case>der Amalj'aa</switch>. Der Befehl lautet: In <switch $n1><case>die Koboldgrube<case>den Ixal-Kahlhieb<case>das Amalj'aa-Feldlager</switch> eindringen, die feindlichen Operationen stören und strategische Informationen sammeln!
#. fr: Ordre de pénétrer <switch $n1><case>dans l'excavation kobolde<case>sur le site de déboisement ixal<case>dans le campement amalj'aa</switch> et d'obtenir des in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions sur les activités ennemies. Le recours à la force est autorisé.
#. column 8: Stronghold Recon
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:11:0:9"
msgid "Reconnoiter the <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch> and assess enemy forces. Avoid engagements when possible, but mission completion takes priority."
msgstr "Разведайте <switch $n1><case>рудник кобольдов<case>лесозаготовки иксалов<case>лагерь амалджаа</switch> и оцените силы противника. По возможности избегайте стычек, но выполнение задания важнее."

#. ja: 行方不明者の捜索
#. de: Rettung einer verbündeten Einheit
#. fr: Recherche de portés disparus
#. column 9: Contact lost with unit deployed in enemy-controlled region of <switch $n1><case>outer La Noscea<case>the North Shroud<case>northern Thanalan</switch>. Locate missing unit, and evacuate surviving members.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:12:0:8"
msgid "Search and Rescue"
msgstr "Поиск и спасение"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>外地ラノシア<case>黒衣森：北部森林<case>北ザナラーン</switch>にて、友軍部隊に行方不明者が出た。敵性勢力の影響力が強い地域だけに、迅速に捜索し救助せよ。
#. de: Die Einheit eines verbündeten Stadt<shy>staates ist <switch $n1><case>im äußeren La Noscea<case>im Nordwald<case>im nördlichen Thanalan</switch> verschollen gegangen. Unmittelbare Feindeinwirkung ist nicht auszuschließen. Der Befehl lautet: Die befreundete Einheit finden und retten!
#. fr: Une unité alliée en poste en terrain ennemi <switch $n1><case>dans la Noscea extérieure<case>dans la Forêt du nord<case>dans le Thanalan septentrional</switch> ne donne plus de signes de vie. Ordre de retrouver ses hommes et de les évacuer.
#. column 8: Search and Rescue
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>outer La Noscea<case>the North Shroud<case>northern Thanalan</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:12:0:9"
msgid "Contact lost with unit deployed in enemy-controlled region of <switch $n1><case>outer La Noscea<case>the North Shroud<case>northern Thanalan</switch>. Locate missing unit, and evacuate surviving members."
msgstr "Связь с подразделением, действовавшим на вражеской территории в <switch $n1><case>Внешней Ла-Носкее<case>Северном лесу<case>Северном Таналане</switch>, потеряна. Найдите пропавших и эвакуируйте выживших."

#. ja: 同盟軍との合同演習
#. de: Gemeinsame Manöverübung
#. fr: Manœuvre générale de l'Alliance
#. column 9: The <switch $n1><case>Immortal Flames invite<case>Maelstrom invites<case>Order of the Twin Adder invites</switch> us to participate in allied maneuvers. Represent the <switch $n1><case>Maelstrom<case>Order of the Twin Adder<case>Immortal Flames</switch>, and uphold our company's reputation for excellence.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:13:0:8"
msgid "Allied Maneuvers"
msgstr "Совместные манёвры"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>不滅隊<case>黒渦団<case>双蛇党</switch>との合同演習が開催される。<switch $n1><case>黒渦団<case>双蛇党<case>不滅隊</switch>の代表として参加し、我が軍の優秀性を示せ。
#. de: Die Eorzäische Allianz hält eine gemeinsame Truppenübung ab. Der Befehl lautet: Als Vertreter <switch $n1><case>des Mahlstroms<case>der Bruderschaft<case>der Legion</switch> an der Übung teilnehmen und unserem Stadt<shy>staat zur Ehre gereichen!
#. fr: Une manœuvre générale doit avoir lieu contre une unité <switch $n1><case>des Immortels<case>du Maelstrom<case>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères</switch>. Ordre d'y participer en faisant honneur à la réputation <switch $n1><case>du Maelstrom<case>de l'ordre des Deux Vipères<case>des Immortels</switch>.
#. column 8: Allied Maneuvers
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Immortal Flames invite<case>Maelstrom invites<case>Order of the Twin Adder invites</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Maelstrom<case>Order of the Twin Adder<case>Immortal Flames</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:13:0:9"
msgid "The <switch $n1><case>Immortal Flames invite<case>Maelstrom invites<case>Order of the Twin Adder invites</switch> us to participate in allied maneuvers. Represent the <switch $n1><case>Maelstrom<case>Order of the Twin Adder<case>Immortal Flames</switch>, and uphold our company's reputation for excellence."
msgstr "<switch $n1><case>Бессмертное пламя приглашает<case>Мальстрём приглашает<case>Орден Двух Змей приглашает</switch> нас на совместные манёвры. На учениях выступите от имени нашей компании — <switch $n1><case>Бессмертного пламени<case>Мальстрёма<case>Ордена Двух Змей</switch> — и поддержите её добрую славу."

#. ja: 重要任務：クリスタル奪取作戦
#. de: ★ Sicherstellung von Kristallvorräten
#. fr: Subtilisation de cristaux (important)
#. column 9: A joint operation is planned to prevent summoning of <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch> by forces entrenched in the <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch>. Cooperate with allies to infiltrate stronghold and seize cache of ritual crystals.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:14:0:8"
msgid "Flagged Mission: Crystal Recovery"
msgstr "Особое задание: захват кристаллов"

#. ja: 敵性蛮族による蛮神<switch $n1><case>タイタン<case>ガルーダ<case>イフリート</switch>召喚を阻害するため、<switch $n1><case>コボルド軍試掘地<case>イクサル軍伐採所<case>アマルジャ軍陣屋</switch>からクリスタルを奪取する作戦が発動された。友軍部隊と協力しつつ敵拠点に潜入、目標物を奪い取れ。
#. de: Der Feind plant eine weitere Beschwörung von <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch>. Unsere Truppen werden in <switch $n1><case>die Koboldgrube<case>den Ixal-Kahlhieb<case>das Amalj'aa-Feldlager</switch> eindringen und die gehorteten Kristalle sichern. Der Befehl lautet: Bei der Erbeutung der Kristalle assistieren!
#. fr: Une opération visant à subtiliser des cristaux <switch $n1><case>dans l'excavation kobolde<case>sur le site de déboisement ixal<case>dans le campement amalj'aa</switch> a été décidée afin d'empêcher l'invocation <switch $n1><case>de Titan<case>de Garuda<case>d'Ifrit</switch>. Ordre de coopérer avec les autres unités pour la faire réussir.
#. column 8: Flagged Mission: Crystal Recovery
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:14:0:9"
msgid "A joint operation is planned to prevent summoning of <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch> by forces entrenched in the <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch>. Cooperate with allies to infiltrate stronghold and seize cache of ritual crystals."
msgstr "Чтобы помешать силам, обосновавшимся в <switch $n1><case>руднике кобольдов<case>лесозаготовках иксалов<case>лагере амалджаа</switch>, призвать <switch $n1><case>Титана<case>Гаруду<case>Ифрита</switch>, готовится совместная операция. Объединитесь с союзниками, проникните в крепость и захватите запас ритуальных кристаллов."

#. ja: 重要任務：クリスタル奪取作戦
#. de: ★ Sicherstellung von Kristallvorräten
#. fr: Subtilisation de cristaux (important)
#. column 9: A joint operation is planned to prevent summoning of <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch> by forces entrenched in the <switch $n1><case>Kobold Dig<case>Ixali logging grounds<case>Amalj'aa encampment</switch>. Cooperate with allies to infiltrate stronghold and seize cache of ritual crystals.
msgctxt "GcArmyExpedition:15:0:8"
msgid "Flagged Mission: Crystal Recovery"
msgstr "Особое задание: захват кристаллов"

#. ja: 敵性蛮族による蛮神<switch $n1><case>タイタン<case>ガルーダ<case>イフリート</switch>召喚を阻害するため、<switch $n1><case>コボルド軍試掘地<case>イクサル軍伐採所<case>アマルジャ軍陣屋</switch>からクリスタルを奪取する作戦が発動された。友軍部隊と協力しつつ敵拠点に潜入、目標物を奪い取れ。
#. de: Der Feind plant eine weitere Beschwörung von <switch $n1><case>Titan<case>Garuda<case>Ifrit</switch>. Unsere Truppen werden in <switch $n1><case>die Koboldgrube<case>den Ixal-Kahlhieb<case>das Amalj'aa-Feldlager</switch> eindringen und die gehorteten Kristalle sichern. Der Befehl lautet: Bei der Erbeutung der Kristalle assistieren!
